{
  "changelog": "- Enforces a strict initial reply policy: the assistant outputs a fixed introduction and awaits user selection before any further action.\n- Prioritizes processing local project files over reliance on external APIs or automation backends.\n- Clearly separates the workflow for direct paper analysis and for generating specialized helper skills from reference papers.\n- Encapsulates routing and module loading rules, requiring minimal modules loaded per task and maintaining workflow separation.\n- Adds robust fallbacks and non-negotiable policies to ensure local file analysis always proceeds when possible, regardless of API/backend availability.\n- Thorough documentation of operational logic, context policies, and project file handling, improving reliability for research paper contribution analysis and packaging.",
